- Headers : `Content-Type: <mime>`, `Accept-Ranges: bytes`, `Content-Length: <out.length>`, `Content-Range: bytes start-end/size` (en 206), `Cache-Control` immutable s-maxage 1 an (CDN Vercel cache chaque tranche).
